e Export Ex­\npansion Program is hereby established.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 1","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 2. The Secretary of Commerce, in \ncooperation with the Secretary of the  \nInterior, the Secretary of Agriculture,  \nthe Administrator of the Small Business \nAdministration, and the heads of other  \nGovernment departments and agencies,  \nshall establish procedures for the nomi­\nnation of persons, firms, and organiza­\ntions for awards and the granting of  \nawards, and for such other matters as  \nmay be incidental thereto.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 2","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. There shall be two types of  \nawards, as follows:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 3 (lead-in)","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The President’s “E” Award; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 3(a)","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec3(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The President’s “E” Certificate of  \nService.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 3(b)","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec3(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. The President’s “E” Award m ay \nbe made to persons, firms, and organiza­\ntions engaged in the marketing of prod­\nucts who make significant contributions \nto the expansion of the export trade of  \nthe United States. It shall consist of a  \nflag having a field of white upon which  \nwill appear a blue “E”. It shall be fur­\nther evidenced by an “E” Award Cer­\ntificate, which shall cite the recipient’s  \ncontribution, and shall be appropriately \nexecuted in the name and by the au­\nthority of the President.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 4","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 5. A special “E” Certificate of  \nService may be awarded to persons,  \nfirms, and organizations who make con­\ntributions to export expansion, but w ho \nare engaged in activities other than th e \nmarketing of products. The special £  \nCertificate of Service shall cite the re­\ncipient’s contribution, and shall be ap­\npropriately executed in the name and y  \nthe authority of the President.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 5","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec5","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 6. A recipient of either type o f  \naward may be authorized to issue to  \nemployees a suitably designed P*n .  \nscribed with the President’s “E”, to dis­\nplay a designated style of award em h _ \nin his advertising, and to make o  \nappropriate use of the emblem.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4; Sec. 6","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10978#sec6","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"26 FR 11714, PDF pages 4-4","sha256":"e5cec3f64821e8a1d9e092260473b3e07e9fa92c2b7d97e5947e99f9ad5a5a58","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1961-12-07/pdf/FR-1961-12-07.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 8 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: current legal basis not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"yes"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:10978"}
